        {
          "title": "Open Deploy App",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On the phone, open the <strong>Work</strong> apps and tap <strong>Deploy App</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/84840932117af60e.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Chrome's first start",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The first time, tap <strong>Stay signed out</strong> or <strong>Use without an account</strong>, whichever Chrome shows.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0c9c55b572c71199.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Signed in",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Deploy App opens as the phone's callsign. Write it on a label on the phone: identical phones look alike in Fleet.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0e281f149b1dc049.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "If it says Certificate Authentication Failed",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The phone is not ready yet, or something went wrong: see <strong>When a phone does not arrive</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
